{"name":"The Bind Sign","slug":"glyph-bind-sign","blurb":"On the bind street, Ivo carries the sign toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Bind. Click the sign and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Bind Sign.","seal":"b6aa55e26ef7f7e931a1287ac99e3eefdcbf8f2b95b2ddc86104563096dc20b7"}
